OL,3,GNorth West
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FA breezy,
OL,6,Fdry evening. However, strengthening
OL,7,Fwinds and rain will arrive during the
OL,8,Fearly hours, freezing onto some roads.
OL,9,FFor the Pennines and Wainwrights, this
OL,10,Fwill fall as snow leading to some
OL,11,Fdisruption come Tuesday morning.
OL,12,
OL,13,CTuesday:FA very wet day to come on
OL,14,FTuesday, with heavy and persistent
OL,15,Frain at times. Strong winds towards
OL,16,Fthe coast and over hills through the
OL,17,Fmorning, easing later.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
